stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Initializing: subscribe(filters, callback)

    Initializing --> Connecting: validate filters
    Initializing --> Failed: validation error

    Connecting --> Active: connected to relays
    Connecting --> Retrying: connection timeout
    Connecting --> Failed: max retries exceeded

    Retrying --> Connecting: retry with backoff
    Retrying --> Failed: max retries exceeded

    Active --> ReceivingEvents: REQ sent

    ReceivingEvents --> ReceivingEvents: EVENT received
    ReceivingEvents --> EndOfStream: EOSE received
    ReceivingEvents --> Paused: pause()
    ReceivingEvents --> Closing: unsubscribe()

    EndOfStream --> ReceivingEvents: new events
    EndOfStream --> Paused: pause()
    EndOfStream --> Closing: unsubscribe()

    Paused --> ReceivingEvents: resume()
    Paused --> Closing: unsubscribe()

    Closing --> Closed: CLOSE sent
    Closed --> [*]

    Failed --> [*]

    note right of ReceivingEvents
        Events are:
        1. Validated
        2. Deduplicated
        3. Cached
        4. Delivered to callback
    end note

    note right of Active
        Health monitoring active
        Metrics being recorded
        Auto-reconnect enabled
    end note
